# Distfiles fetched at build time by the fetch.sh scripts, and the trees
# they unpack to.  Required inputs, not build products: deleting them
# costs a re-download.  Only the two that this configuration actually
# uses are listed; the gcc/gmp/mpfr/mpc/gmake fetches are gated on
# HAVE_GCC and never run.
